						 <div style="text-align: right;"></div> <p><strong>First Focumented Instance Of SCP-5655’s Weekly Phenomenon:</strong></p> <p><strong>Interviewer:</strong> Dr H█████ Atlis</p> <p><strong>Interviewee:</strong> scp-5655</p> <p><strong>Date:</strong> 23/6/20██</p> <hr /> <blockquote> <p><strong>[BEGIN LOG]</strong></p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> Uhh hello? Can any of you fancy chaps hear me? I know you, you right there can with your nicely pressed suit.</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> (through intercom) if you wouldn't mind me asking, how are you able to communicate with us? Only being a skull and all.</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> oh not to worry, that has no bearing on the situation at hand, i would like to speak to the headman of this fine establishment</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> that would be me, yes (steps away from the mic) i want that full cell scanned and i want any possible reason its able to speak found</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> i can assure you sir, my comprehension of the queen's english is not strange, but we should really get to business Mr………?</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> Doctor, Doctor Atlis, and what business are you referring to?</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> Finally! A man with qualifications, and the business I'm referring to is that of bones, now you wouldn't happen to have any on hand, would you lad?</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> You want bones? Do you mean human, or will any animal do?</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> Oh any will do Mr Doctor , i'm not known for being picky.</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> Hmmm, unfortunately i cannot grant your request at this time scp-5655, as more research is required to determine whether you’re a threat or not.</p> <p><strong>Scp-5655:</strong> ahah but… uh Mr Doctor, you don't seem to fully understand the situation i see. But.. I must realise that this is our first meeting, and I'm sure you don't want to leave a bad impression, I'll let it slide just this time.</p> <p><strong>Dr Atlis:</strong> Oh well thanks i guess, would you mind answering a few questions for us?</p> <p><strong>[END LOG]</strong></p> </blockquote> <hr /> <p><strong>Post interview report</strong></p> <p>The discovery of scp-5655’s sentience was a complete shock to everyone working on it, and being able to hold a conversation with it means it's intelligent of some sort, further testing required to determine exact intelligence. Scp-5655 seems to have a strange interest with bones of any sort. further testing s required to determine whether granting scp-5655's request is safe. unfortunately scp-5655 seemed to become dormant again before i was able to ask any questions, the sudden dormancy may be connected to not receiving any bones, further research required. End Report</p> <p><strong>Signed:</strong> Dr H█████ Atlis</p> <hr /> <p>by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons" ><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6346785&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1607372471" alt="Sami Gibbons" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6346785)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/sami-gibbons" >Sami Gibbons</a></span></p> 
				 	]]>
